{"linuxonandroid":{"description":"The revival of the popular method of installing linux on android.\n\nThis is an open-source Android application designed to download, provision, and run full-featured Linux distributions (including Ubuntu 26.04 LTS, Debian 13, Fedora 45, Alpine Linux 3.24, Arch Linux ARM, Kali Linux, and Void Linux) natively on Android devices without requiring root permissions.","screenshots":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/1_dashboard.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/2_terminal.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/3_desktop.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/4_software_hub.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/5_container_overview.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/6_distro_wizard.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/7_settings_themes.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/devwithzachary/LinuxOnAndroid/main/fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/8_welcome_onboarding.png"]}}